Subject: Cantor EVO-X2 Plan-Only Build Job P0 Local Package Review

@ [implementation_review_uuid] 14e4091e-3554-4979-b5b5-2fc8b5f78b90
@ [implementation_proof_uuid] 7ae2a821-bd0c-43f6-932d-44090eb15ada
@ [canonical_uuid] 3482e2ce-817c-4788-b185-35adaad414f7

& [PositiveCase]
  + package is constructed entirely from an immutable Git archive and contains only the two native planner binaries exact request and six public evidence files
  + verifier closes case-fold membership file byte hash aggregate self-digest request shape and authority-grant boundaries on both PowerShell hosts
  + live harness fixes host roots process cardinality evidence retrieval protected/provider conservation and transient cleanup before network authority opens
  + deployment cannot report passed until the separately authored local evidence verifier replays both native verifications and closes receipt audit and conservation identities

& [ChallengeCase]
  + compiler binaries built from equal source may not be byte-reproducible across arbitrary toolchain path or host differences; this slice proves exact packaged identities and deterministic plan output instead
  + deploy behavior is statically and pre-network tested but remote path ACL ZIP SSH timing and provider availability remain unobserved until the one bounded run
  + provider conservation preflight intentionally fails closed if the pinned listener model or process identity is absent

& [Resolution]
  + package hashes are authoritative for installation while semantic compiler/verifier outputs supply the cross-process reproducibility claim
  + the external package verifier governs local custody while the published deployment harness independently repeats manifest self-digest membership file hash aggregate and exact-file-count checks remotely
  + live receipt retains durations and before/after identities without promoting them to source-build throughput
  + any absent root collision package mismatch provider drift protected-state drift process residue or output mismatch stops or quarantines without physical build authority

& [Decision]
  + approve implementation publication and immediate bookend; only then admit the single bounded EVO-X2 install and plan-compilation run
